<main class="relative flex flex-col items-start justify-center p-2 sm:p-6 overflow-x-hidden">

  <%= image_tag "top-monster-fridge.png",
      class: "absolute top-0 right-[-3rem] w-64 sm:w-80 sm:top-0 sm:right-0 md:w-92 md:right-84 opacity-90 pointer-events-none select-none" %>

  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl sm:px-6 sm:py-10">
    <div class="relative max-w-3xl text-left">
      <p class="mt-16 sm:mt-1 inline-block text-sm sm:text-base text-teal-700 font-semibold my-2 bg-white/80 rounded-full px-3 py-1">
        <%= t('.description') %>
      </p>
      <h3 class="ml-2 text-2xl sm:text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-exo2 font-bold leading-tight text-slate-700">
        期限が近い食材が<br>
        ひと目でわかる。<br>
        <span  class="text-pink-600">食べきって廃棄ゼロへ</span>
      </h3>

      <p class="mt-4 ml-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <span class="font-semibold">食材登録→LINE通知→食べた/捨てた</span>
        を記録。<br>
        続けるほど
        <span class="font-semibold">キャラが進化</span>
        して、あなたの冷蔵庫がキレイに。
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-row justify-start gap-4 pt-4 ml-2 mb-4">
        <%= link_to new_user_session_path, class: "flex items-center gap-x-2 bg-orange-400 hover:bg-orange-500 text-white font-semibold px-4 py-2 test-sm sm:text-base rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-200" do %>
          <span>今すぐはじめる</span>
        <% end %>
        <div data-controller="how-to-modal" class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 font-mono">
          <button data-action="click->how-to-modal#open" class= "flex items-center bg-white text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700 border border-gray-500 rounded-xl shadow-lg px-4 py-2 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-200">
            使い方を見る
          </button>
          <div data-how-to-modal-target="modal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-[60]">
            <%= render "shared/how_to_modal" %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-36 mb-16 sm:my-16 md:my-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center animate-bounce">
      <span class="text-orange-700 text-sm font-semibold">Scroll</span>
      <%= heroicon "chevron-double-down", variant: :solid, options: { class: "w-5 h-5 text-orange-700" } %>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 md:mt-24  w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-4">
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-exo2 font-semibold text-slate-800">
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-pink-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">FridgeBell</span>
          でできること
        </h2>
      </div>
      <%= render "shared/feature_cards" %>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-6 w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto  flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-exo2 font-semibold text-slate-800">
          <span class="bg-orange-100 text-orange-600 font-bold text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full tracking-wide">3ステップ</span>
          で始められます
        </h3>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white my-2 p-4 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl w-full font-mono" data-aos="zoom-in-up" data-aos-duration="2000" data-aos-delay="500">
        <p class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-xs text-gray-500">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1">STEP 1</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 font-semibold text-sm">食材を登録</span>
          <video autoplay loop muted playsinline width="180" class="mx-auto block my-2 rounded-lg shadow ring-1 ring-gray-200">
            <source src="https://i.gyazo.com/6c87af896cbffbd72142360fcfac7d82.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          </video>
          カテゴリーから選び、数量と期限を入力
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white my-2 p-4 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl w-full font-mono" data-aos="zoom-in-up" data-aos-duration="2000" data-aos-delay="500">
        <p class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-xs text-gray-500">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1">STEP 2</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 font-semibold text-sm">リマインドを設定</span>
          <video autoplay loop muted playsinline width="180" class="mx-auto block my-2 rounded-lg shadow ring-1 ring-gray-200">
            <source src="https://i.gyazo.com/f770f799035c05f171ebb71c11ac5a12.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          </video>
          期限〇日前と通知時刻を設定（LINEでお知らせ）
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white my-2 p-4 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl w-full font-mono" data-aos="zoom-in-up" data-aos-duration="2000" data-aos-delay="500">
        <p class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-xs text-gray-500">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1">STEP 3</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 font-semibold text-sm">食べた/捨てたを記録</span>
          <video autoplay loop muted playsinline width="220" class="mx-auto block my-2 rounded-lg shadow ring-1 ring-gray-200">
            <source src="https://i.gyazo.com/98a3f7bedd8f7541a6e42a586b91834d.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          </video>
          チェックと数量を入力して、かんたんに消費・廃棄を登録
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
